title: Serialize/HorizRule-normalized
description: AST-only mode writes a horizontal rule of four or more dashes as three
tags: $:/tags/wikitext-serialize-normalize-spec
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki-multiple

title: info

`----` and longer rules become `---` without the source.

Why: the parse tree records a bare `hr` element without the dash count, so
the serializer emits three dashes; with the source it keeps the written count.

* Covers: $:/plugins/tiddlywiki/wikitext-serialize/rules/horizrule.js.
* Mode: ast-only (the Input field withholds the source from the serializer).
